{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53179","headline":"诗偈 四 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"余家久住山，早已离城市。\n草屋有三间，一间长丈二。\n一间安葛五，一间尘六四。\n余家自内房，终日闲无事。\n昨因黑月二十五，初夜饮酒醉，两人相浑杂，种种调言气。\n余家不奈烦，放火烧屋积。\n葛五成灰烬，尘六无一二。\n有物荡净尽，惟余空闲地。\n自身赤裸裸，体上无衣被。\n更莫忧盗贼，逍遥安乐睡。\n一等被火烧，同行不同利。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53179.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53179","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}